Treat alignment docs as planning guidance. Verify current code before assuming planned learner routes/components already exist.

## Current Learner/Course Status

Existing DB/schema and scripts already model course-related content: `course`, `course_enrollment`, `course_module`, `course_module_in_course`, `course_module_requires`, `course_module_review`, `module_completion`, `module_uses_artifact`, and `challenge`.

Current app routes `/learn`, `/courses`, and `/challenges` exist but are placeholder-level until the learner milestone is implemented. Planned routes include `/modules`, `/modules/[moduleSlug]`, `/courses/[slug]`, `/courses/[courseSlug]/m/[moduleSlug]`, and `/challenges/[slug]`.
